WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:09.469
Cozlin rubbed her head. "That was a big explosion!"

2
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.135
"Help!" an alien cried.

3
00:00:13.136 --> 00:00:18.232
Cozlin gasped. "That building is falling over!"

4
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:20.282
She flew fast.

5
00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:24.827
"Grr!" She slowly pushed the building back up.

6
00:00:24.828 --> 00:00:27.065
But now it leaned the other way.

7
00:00:27.066 --> 00:00:29.485
And bricks were falling.

8
00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:32.323
Bricks fell toward an old alien.

9
00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:38.328
Zoom! Cozlin quickly saved her.

10
00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:41.097
"Thank you, Rocket—oh!

11
00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:45.502
You're not Rocket Girl!" the alien said.

12
00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:50.005
"Nope," Cozlin said. "I'm Kid Comet!

13
00:00:50.006 --> 00:00:55.035
But why did you think I was Rocket Girl? She's a villain."

14
00:00:55.036 --> 00:01:02.000
"No way!" the alien said. "Rocket Girl is a hero!"

15
00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:04.637
There was a loud groan.

16
00:01:04.638 --> 00:01:07.630
The building was falling again!

17
00:01:07.631 --> 00:01:10.249
More bricks fell.

18
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.449
Cozlin caught the bricks.

19
00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.983
She pushed the building again.

20
00:01:14.984 --> 00:01:17.289
But it was still leaning.

21
00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:23.967
"I can't do this by myself!" Cozlin looked around.

22
00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.300
Roxy was still lying in the street.

23
00:01:26.301 --> 00:01:29.282
She was knocked out.

24
00:01:29.283 --> 00:01:31.641
Cozlin took out her power crystal.

25
00:01:31.642 --> 00:01:34.992
"I hope this works . . ."

26
00:01:34.993 --> 00:01:37.458
She put the crystal in Roxy's hand.

27
00:01:37.459 --> 00:01:40.822
The crystal glowed brightly.

28
00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:48.125
Roxy's eyes flew open. "What happened?"

29
00:01:48.126 --> 00:01:51.189
"We caused an explosion."

30
00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.637
Cozlin put the crystal in her pocket.

31
00:01:53.638 --> 00:01:57.803
"I need your help. We have to save everyone!"

32
00:01:57.804 --> 00:02:03.726
She pointed at the building.

33
00:02:03.727 --> 00:02:07.669
"Follow me!" Roxy shot into the air.

34
00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:11.464
Roxy flew on one side of the building. Cozlin

35
00:02:11.465 --> 00:02:14.037
flew on the other side. They

36
00:02:14.038 --> 00:02:17.236
both pushed carefully. Finally

37
00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:21.032
the building stood still. "This

38
00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:24.504
building will fall down soon," Roxy said. "I

39
00:02:24.505 --> 00:02:27.808
have to move it. But there are people inside. I

40
00:02:27.809 --> 00:02:31.155
can't move it safely . . ." Zoom!

41
00:02:31.156 --> 00:02:34.602
Cozlin disappeared. A

42
00:02:34.603 --> 00:02:38.672
moment later all the people stood on the street below. "Whoa,"

43
00:02:38.673 --> 00:02:41.223
Roxy said. Cozlin

44
00:02:41.224 --> 00:02:45.775
grinned. "I can move pretty fast." Roxy

45
00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:52.289
lifted the building and carried it away from the city. "Wow!"

46
00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:58.601
Cozlin thought. "She's strong!" "How

47
00:02:58.602 --> 00:03:01.949
did you wake me up?" Roxy asked. Cozlin

48
00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.061
showed her the power crystal. Roxy

49
00:03:05.062 --> 00:03:10.051
frowned. "Is that what you stole?" "It

50
00:03:10.052 --> 00:03:15.986
was stolen from one of my planet's satellites," Cozlin said. She

51
00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:20.787
told Roxy about Delkor and the power crystals. "Sorry,"

52
00:03:20.788 --> 00:03:23.724
Roxy said. "No

53
00:03:23.725 --> 00:03:28.532
problem," Cozlin said. "I'm glad I met you. I

54
00:03:28.533 --> 00:03:32.356
always wondered if there was anyone else like me." Roxy

55
00:03:32.357 --> 00:03:39.315
smiled. "Me too!" ***

56
00:03:39.316 --> 00:03:41.972
Cozlin returned to school.

57
00:03:41.973 --> 00:03:46.274
Everyone was outside at recess.

58
00:03:46.275 --> 00:03:49.925
"Did I miss anything?" she asked.

59
00:03:49.926 --> 00:03:55.419
Febby burped. "You missed the gross space beans!"

60
00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.282
"You also missed Kid Comet."

61
00:03:58.283 --> 00:04:00.725
Mert gave her a suspicious look.

62
00:04:00.726 --> 00:04:05.055
"You're never around when she is."

63
00:04:05.056 --> 00:04:09.061
Cozlin shrugged. Then she picked up a ball.

64
00:04:09.062 --> 00:04:18.786
"Let's play!"

